# CNB Procfile — declares the launch processes that buildpacks register.
#
# - web: production launch. Plain node, no watcher overhead.
# - dev: development launch. nodemon with -L (legacy polling mode) so
#   the watcher works through containerd/overlayfs filesystems where
#   inotify events from `tar | kubectl exec` syncs aren't reliably
#   propagated to user-space watchers. Uses pure stat() polling at
#   1s default intervals — sufficient for save->reload UX, negligible
#   CPU on dev builds. nodemon ships in devDependencies.
web: node src/index.js
dev: nodemon -L src/index.js
